<title>USA: St. Joseph, Minn. won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>St. Joseph, Minn. won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $1.235 million of St. Joseph, Minn., general obligation bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.52 percent.</p>
